ose-nebulaa\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"title: \\\"The 7-Step LinkedIn Strategy That Gravity Runs For You\\\"\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"category: \\\"Marketing Automation\\\"\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"date: \\\"March 5, 2026\\\"\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"readTime: \\\"7 min read\\\"\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"4\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"author: \\\"Nebulaa Team\\\"\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"5\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"h1\",\"6\",{\"className\":\"font-heading text-3xl font-bold text-brand-text dark:text-white mt-10 mb-4 tracking-tight\",\"children\":\"The 7-Step LinkedIn Strategy That Gravity Runs For You (That Would Take You 8 Hours/Week)\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"7\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"8\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"Most founders know they should be posting on LinkedIn. Almost none of them actually do it consistently. The reason isn't laziness — it's the invisible cost of the creative process.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"9\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"10\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"Writing one post doesn't take 5 minutes. It takes 40. There's research, drafting, second-guessing, editing, formatting, scheduling. Do that three times a week and you've spent 2 hours you didn't have.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"11\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"12\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"Gravity solves this. Here's exactly how.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"13\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"h2\",\"14\",{\"className\":\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-brand-text dark:text-white mt-8 mb-3 tracking-tight\",\"children\":\"Step 1: Brand Voice Ingestion (Done Once)\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"15\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"16\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"The first thing Gravity does is read your website. Every page — home, about, product, blog. It extracts:\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"17\",{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\",\"children\":\"•\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Your vocabulary and tone\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"18\",{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\",\"children\":\"•\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"The specific problems you solve\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"19\",{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\",\"children\":\"•\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"The audience you write for\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"20\",{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\",\"children\":\"•\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"How you talk about competitors\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"21\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"22\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"This takes about 60 seconds. After this, Gravity doesn't just know what you do. It writes like you.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"23\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"h2\",\"24\",{\"className\":\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-brand-text dark:text-white mt-8 mb-3 tracking-tight\",\"children\":\"Step 2: ICP Mapping\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"25\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"26\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"Next, Gravity identifies your Ideal Customer Profile from your existing content. It cross-references this with LinkedIn audience data to understand what content format converts for your segment:\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"27\",{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\",\"children\":\"•\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Founders → story-driven, insight posts\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"28\",{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\",\"children\":\"•\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Marketers → tactical, framework posts\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"29\",{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\",\"children\":\"•\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"SMB owners → result-driven, case-study posts\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"30\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"h2\",\"31\",{\"className\":\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-brand-text dark:text-white mt-8 mb-3 tracking-tight\",\"children\":\"Step 3: Competitor Intelligence\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"32\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"33\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"Gravity tracks the top 3 competitors you identify (or discovers them automatically from your website). Every day, it notes what they're posting, what topics they're targeting, and where there are content gaps.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"34\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"35\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"This feeds the content calendar automatically.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"36\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"h2\",\"37\",{\"className\":\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-brand-text dark:text-white mt-8 mb-3 tracking-tight\",\"children\":\"Step 4: The Daily Content Queue\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"38\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"39\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"Every morning, Gravity generates 3 posts:\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"40\",{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\",\"children\":\"•\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"1 thought leadership piece (LinkedIn long-form)\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"41\",{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\",\"children\":\"•\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"1 short-form hook (Twitter/X thread starter)\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"42\",{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\",\"children\":\"•\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"1 visual caption (Instagram)\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"43\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"44\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"Each post is uniquely written. No templates, no fill-in-the-blanks.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"45\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"h2\",\"46\",{\"className\":\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-brand-text dark:text-white mt-8 mb-3 tracking-tight\",\"children\":\"Step 5: Festival & Trend Layer\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"47\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"48\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"Indian founders know that content tied to cultural moments performs significantly better. Budget Day analysis. IPL take. Diwali campaign. Gravity has a built-in calendar of 80+ Indian cultural moments per year and drafts content for each one — 3 days in advance.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"49\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"h2\",\"50\",{\"className\":\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-brand-text dark:text-white mt-8 mb-3 tracking-tight\",\"children\":\"Step 6: Scheduling and Publishing\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"51\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"52\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"Once posts are in the queue, Gravity handles the rest. Optimal posting times are calculated per platform based on your audience's activity. Posts go live automatically. You get a morning summary of what went live.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"53\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"h2\",\"54\",{\"className\":\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-brand-text dark:text-white mt-8 mb-3 tracking-tight\",\"children\":\"Step 7: Performance Learning\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"55\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"56\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"Over time, Gravity learns which of your posts get the most engagement and adjusts the content style accordingly. The longer you use it, the better it gets.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"57\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"58\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"59\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-sm text-brand-muted dark:text-white/50 italic my-2\",\"children\":\"Want to see Gravity write your first 7 days of LinkedIn content? Start your free trial — no card needed.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"60\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$La\",null,{}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-8 bg-brand-gold-pale dark:bg-brand-gold/8 border border-brand-gold/20 dark:border-brand-gold/15 rounded-2xl p-6 text-center\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"font-heading text-lg font-bold text-brand-text dark:text-white mb-2\",\"children\":\"Ready to automate your GTM?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-sm text-brand-muted dark:text-white/50 mb-4\",\"children\":\"100 free credits. No card required. Setup in 24 hours.\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"/pricing\",\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-brand-gold text-brand-black font-body font-semibold rounded-full px-6 py-3 hover:bg-brand-gold-dim transition-all hover:scale-[1.03]\",\"children\":\"Start your free trial →\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-8 text-center\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"/blog\",\"className\":\"font-body text-sm text-brand-muted dark:text-white/30 hover:text-brand-gold dark:hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors\",\"children\":\"← Back to all posts\"}]}]]}]}]\n9:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}],[\"$\",\"m